{"title":"2020 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_THINK!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY THINK!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of the following expression?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f4f7b3d646f920fd9ef3f767aad765860768b41.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{100^2-7^2}{70^2-11^2} \\cdot \\frac{(70-11)(70+11)}{(100-7)(100+7)}\\]\" width=\"236\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/b/afb3d180373767f77bb6754fd11911437c1e62b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{9951}{9950} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\frac{4780}{4779} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{108}{107} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\frac{81}{80}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"453\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using difference of squares to factor the left term, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd5ad760781142ae19f9ab08f756ab9c74008f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{100^2-7^2}{70^2-11^2} \\cdot \\frac{(70-11)(70+11)}{(100-7)(100+7)} = \\frac{(100-7)(100+7)}{(70-11)(70+11)} \\cdot \\frac{(70-11)(70+11)}{(100-7)(100+7)}.\\]\" width=\"561\" height=\"44\" />\nCancelling all the terms, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3b0a524fcc5f01e0060f6aff04c67ded46bb245.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" /> as the answer.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_THINK.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CREATIVELY_THINK!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY THINK!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO CREATIVELY THINK!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/2z8MaCeqIKs\">https://youtu.be/2z8MaCeqIKs</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WfTty8Fe5Fo\">https://youtu.be/WfTty8Fe5Fo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B\" title=\"2020 AMC 12B\">2020 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2020 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\